# Claws Out: "Affinity for Cats" (CR 702.41a) costs {1} less for each Cat you control, and "creatures you control get +2/+2 until
# end of turn". Bot1's Prideful Parent (a Cat Beast) makes a Cat token on turn 1, so Claws Out ({3}{W}{W}) would cost {1}{W}{W}
# with two Cats: with only Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire untapped the cast is refused. Ajani's Pridemate (a Cat Soldier) makes three
# Cats, and on turn 3 the cast with {W}{W} alone (Mox Sapphire stays untapped) is accepted. The three attackers hit for
# 4 + 3 + 4 = 11 (the Cat token is 1/1) and Bot2's Memnite, which is not Bot1's creature, is not pumped.

